<title>BELGIUM: NMKN/SNCI TO LOWER INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>NMKN/SNCI TO LOWER INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian investment credit bank</p>
<p>NMKN/SNCI said on Monday it would cut interest rates on its</p>
<p>investment credits from February 5 as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY			    NEW RATE	CHANGE</p>
<p>    three-year revisable	    5.45 pct	-25 bp</p>
<p>    five-year revisable	     6.30 pct	-30 bp</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
